{
  "name": "Army of One",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn how to summon an ever-increasing number of creatures to your side. When you cast a conjuration or necromancy spell to summon a creature, you can choose to ignore the Concentration limit on that spell. But if you do so, you reduce the spell's duration to 1 minute.</p><p>If you lose Concentration, you lose it on all spells you're concentrating on.</p>",
